# Templates: a saved plan starred as a template shows in its own group;
# clicking it starts a new, unsaved plan with its order, dated today.
wait 2500
rename Domingo
section 15 Alabanza
slot !yt
add fixtures/image.png
press ctrl+s
wait 300
template Domingo
press ctrl+o
wait 500
shot 1-templates-listed
from-template Domingo
wait 600
shot 2-new-from-template
